<title>USA: Jones Apparel names Nemerov president.</title>
<headline>Jones Apparel names Nemerov president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jones Apparel Group Inc said Monday it had named Jackwyn Nemerov as president.</p>
<p>Nemerov joined Jones Apparel in 1985 and is currently president of the company's Casual divisions.</p>
<p>Nemerov was president of the Gloria Vanderbilt division of Murjani Inc from 1980 through 1985.</p>
